  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Service Reform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Service delivery is a core component of the Armenian Governments strategy on Public Service Reform. The strategy calls for introduction of improvements to citizen service delivery  with the goal of making government services citizen centric, including adoption of transparent mechanisms for collecting and evaluating feedback and accountable governance. The Information Systems Agency of Armenia is supporting the reform project through managing the delivery of 12 pilot life event digital transformation projects  working in collaboration with Armenian ministries to coordinate the projects, carry out research and deliver tangible results to citizens, in line with the digital architecture of Armenia.</narrative>
  </description>
